            "value" : "要输入的内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, captures at the display's native pixel resolution. When disabled, captures at the logical (1x) resolution. Has no effect on non-Retina displays" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启后，按显示器的原生像素分辨率捕捉。关闭后，按逻辑（1x）分辨率捕捉。对非视网膜显示器无效"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, the cursor is left out of the video so the editor can redraw it smoothly. Recordings have no cursor until edited." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，光标不会包含在视频中，以便编辑器平滑地重新绘制它。编辑之前，录制内容中没有光标。"
